1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,180
The East York Juniors Soccer Club is launching a membership and fund-raising drive to start off the new season.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:13,400
The club's secretary has told our local sports reporter that the club may be forced to close this year due to financial problems.

3
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:24,340
He would like to encourage all parents to consider the benefits to children and the community by supporting the local soccer club, which has been working in this community for the last sixty years.

4
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:30,100
The annual membership fee has been raised to forty dollars in order to cover the cost of maintaining club facilities.

5
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:34,920
The club is also seeking volunteers to work as officials and umpires.

6
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:40,300
Anyone with first aid or coaching experience is most welcome to join the coaching team.
